fail[3]: There's one group, and its three values all differ.
fail[4]: The only group has two 5s.
fail[5]: Every group of 3 positions out of 4 has three different values: 4 groups.
fail[6]: The values 1 to 10 appear 10 times each. There are 120 ways to choose 3 different values, and 10 × 10 × 10 ways to choose a position for each: 120,000.
